@startuml
|User|
start
:Open project feed;
|System|
if (Projects exist?) then (yes)
  :Show project cards;
  |User|
  :Select a project;
  |System|
  if (Project still exists?) then (yes)
    :Show project details;
  else (no)
    :Show error;
    :Refresh feed;
  endif
else (no)
  :Show empty-state message;
endif
stop
@enduml
